/* 
 * When you're fishing on the beach and the campfire party is present. They can offer to cook the fish you catch if it's big enough, and can react to
 * you catching a fish or eating a fish.
 */
:: Fishing Beach Cat Eat Party
<<set $daily.fishing.beach.partyFeed to "declined">>
The teens by the campfire go silent as they watch you drop the whole <<print $fishingHookedFish.type>> in your mouth. <<transform cat 1>><<lstress>><<stress -6>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Cast back out|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Return to the beach|Beach]]>><</link>>


:: Beach Party Fish Cook
You carry the <<print $fishingHookedFish.type>> over to the teens by the fire. They whoop as one of them pulls out a knife and cleans it as best they can. In a few minutes, it's sizzling over the flames.
<br><br>

You and the others tear into it once it's done. It's messy, smoky, and a little sandy, but it tastes great. <<stress -12>><<llstress>><<status 25>><<ggcool>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Return to Fishing|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Stick around|Beach Party]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Beach Throw Back Party
<<set $daily.fishing.beach.partyFeed to "declined">>
You toss the <<print $fishingHookedFish.type>> back into the sea, ignoring the groans and jeers that rise from the campfire behind you.
<br><br>

<<link [[Cast back out|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Return to the beach|Beach]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Beach Keep Party
<<set $daily.fishing.beach.partyFeed to "declined">>
You stow the <<print $fishingHookedFish.type>> away, ignoring the groans and jeers that rise from the campfire behind you.
<<tending_give $fishingHookedFish.type 1>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Cast back out|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Return to the beach|Beach]]>><</link>>



:: Widgets Fishing Beach Campfire Party [widget]

<<widget "fishingWaitAmbientCampfireParty">>
	<<if beachCampfirePartyPresent()>>
		<<addinlineevent 3>>
			You smell smoke wafting from the campfire.
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent 3>>
			You hear laughter from the campfire.
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

/* ========================== */
/* ===== Combat Widgets ===== */
/* ========================== */

<<widget "fishCombatBeachCaughtCampfireCook">>
	<<set _canEatFish to canEatFishTf($fishingHookedFish)>>
	<<run updateFishRecord($fishingHookedFish.type, $fishingHookedFish.size, "beach")>>
	<<fishingCatchFishText "beach">>
	<<run endFishingCombat()>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.beach.partyFeed to "offering">>

	You hear cheers from the campfire. Someone calls out asking if you'll share the <<print $fishingHookedFish.type>> so they can cook it for everyone.
	<br><br>

	<<if _canEatFish>>
		It's such a small fish, you could probably fit the whole thing in your mouth.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<link [[Have them cook the fish|Beach Party Fish Cook]]>><<pass 15>><<set $daily.fishing.beach.partyFeed to "accepted">><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if _canEatFish>>
		<<link [[Eat the fish|Fishing Beach Cat Eat Party]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Stow it away|Fishing Beach Keep]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [["Throw the " + $fishingHookedFish.type + " back"|Fishing Beach Throw Back Party]]>><</link>>
<</widget>>
